5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura. This looks like fun! Who wants to play a guessing game?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,Hello. I am Minako. Let us observe the group dynamics carefully before making any moves.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Greetings. I will remain quiet and watch. Silence often reveals more than words do.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey! I'm Takumi. I'm ready to protect my friends. Let's figure this out together!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I am Misaki. I will listen to what you all have to say first.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako That sounds serious! I like a challenge. I'm feeling pretty lucky today, actually!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,@Sakura Luck is not a strategy. We need facts. Who feels most suspicious right now?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,I do not trust luck. I trust logic. Let us see who speaks first with conviction.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't know who to trust yet, but I'll keep my eyes open. No one is safe!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Minako. Facts are important. I will stay calm and observe.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,@Takumi You sound so brave! I hope you don't get too scared. I'm just here to have fun!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,@Sakura Your enthusiasm is noted. But we must be cautious. Who else has an opinion?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I am still gathering information. I will not rush to judgment. Patience is key.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not scared! I'm ready. Let's find the wolf before it finds us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I am also waiting. Let us see how the night plays out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Okay! I'm ready for night. Goodnight everyone! I'll dream of puppies!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Goodnight. I will use my ability wisely. Stay safe, everyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,Goodnight. I will watch the shadows.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Goodnight! I'll keep watch. Let's win this!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Goodnight. I will rest.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
